<!-- The W.D. Va. brief in support of a motion, Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in
     the face of the typst template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 12 pt (size 24 half points). No local rule sets a
     size, margin or spacing for a brief (W.D. Va. Local Rules 11(a), 11(c)(1); ../README.md): the values are the
     convention both exemplars show. Body Text in exact 27.6 pt line boxes (552 twips: typst pitch-body, Word's double
     line at 12 pt) with a half-inch first-line indent; Body Keep the same kept with
     the next paragraph (the short final section,
     kept on the page of the signature); heading 1 a centered bold line in a 27.6 pt box, 13.8 pt below the text
     above; headings 2 to 4 bold in 13.8 pt boxes (276 twips: typst pitch-single), 13.8 pt below the text above, the
     number in a 0.4 in label hung from the margin, each level half an inch further in (576, 1296, 2016 twips);
     Block Text single-spaced, half an inch in on both sides, a single line from the text; footnotes 11 pt (22 half
     points) in 12.65 pt boxes (253 twips: typst pitch-note), 7 pt after each (typst footnote.entry gap); List Item
     the label in a half-inch box; letter page with 1-inch margins and the page number centered in a 13.8 pt line,
     36.75 pt above the page foot (735 twips: where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %). docx/vawd-motion-brief.lua
     writes the cover, signature and certificate with their own spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
